<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90505" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προτέρ-ω</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>further, forwards</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴθυσαν δὲ πολὺ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.507
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὼ δὲ βάτην π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				9.192
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλ᾽ ἕπεο π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				18.387
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μερμήριξε δ᾽ . . ἢ π . . . διώκοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.672
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαίεσθαι π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.356
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτι π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.526
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.417
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καί νύ κε δὴ π. ἔτ᾽ ἔρις
				γένετ᾽</span> the quarrel would have gone <i>further</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.490
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ πῄ με π. ἄξεις</span>;
			wilt thou carry me <i>further away?</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				3.400
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτ᾽ οὐ π</span>. no
			<i>further</i>, no <i>more</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.919
			</span></i>: c. gen. loci, <i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				923
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of Time,
				<i>sooner</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Dian.</u>
				72
			</span></i>.</div>
